  "notes": "{捩|ね}じる means to twist something with rotational force.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Pair: {捩|ね}じれる (intransitive, to become twisted)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {腕|うで}を{捩|ね}じる: to twist someone's arm\n- {体|からだ}を{捩|ね}じる: to twist one's body\n- {蓋|ふた}を{捩|ね}じる: to twist a lid/cap\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {回|まわ}す: to turn, rotate\n- ひねる: to twist (lighter touch)\n- {絞|しぼ}る: to wring, squeeze\n\n[Register: Neutral]",
